sequenceDiagram
    participant IDE as Forge IDE
    participant MC as Mission Control API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Forge as Forge GPU worker
    participant Model as Local model adapter

    IDE->>MC: Submit chat turn
    MC->>DB: Save job and queued event
    DB-->>MC: Commit confirmed
    MC-->>IDE: 202 Accepted with run ID

    Note over DB,Forge: Jobs stay queued while Forge is offline
    Forge->>DB: Subscribe and claim work
    DB-->>Forge: Job and attempt token
    Forge->>Model: Run inference locally
    Forge->>DB: Renew lease during inference
    Model-->>Forge: Reply or failure

    Forge->>DB: Publish result for this attempt
    DB-->>MC: Wake completion consumer
    MC->>DB: Save reply and terminal event

    IDE->>MC: Request next event page
    MC->>DB: Read authorized run and events
    DB-->>MC: Status, events and saved reply
    MC-->>IDE: Return events and saved reply
